"entity": {
"name": "Worthington Steel, Inc.",
"description": "Worthington Steel, Inc. engages in the steel processing business in connection with the separation and the distribution. Its products include cold rolled steel, hot rolled, galvanized, first operation blanking, dry film lubricant, cut-to-length sheets, pickling, annealing, one pass rolling, temper rolling, slitting, and oscillate slitting. The company was founded in 1955 and is headquartered in Columbus, OH.",
